# Per-deployment values: the API URL and the Cognito user of whoever deployed it
bruno-tests/environments/Dev.bru

# Logins for the dev Cognito users, sourced by the shell to request tokens. One file per
# stack, named after it: .env.EtiyaDev. Acceptable for throwaway dev users only —
# production credentials never go in a file, they are exported for the command that needs them.
# The pattern is deliberately wide: no .env of any name is ever meant to be committed
.env*
